  "transferModeSshfsBootDesc2": "QEMU drive-mirror live-pivots disks from SSHFS-mounted source to local LVM. ~30s real downtime. Multi-disk capable. Recommended for most workloads — limit to 1-2 concurrent VMs to keep mirror throughput high.",
